# Ignore everything by default, then explicitly include the redistributable
# source/repro files for the public repo.
*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!MODERN-CONTROLS.md
!OVERRIDES.md
!TEXTURE-MATCHING.md
!GPU-RENDERING.md
!Play-User-Textures.cmd
!Play-GPU-Preview.cmd
